cmu-paramarines-rules = You are a paratrooper of the Third World Empire's IASF Parachute Regiment. Follow your team leader, complete the mission, and uphold the honour of the Empress. You are hostile to the UPP, and neutral to everyone else unless provoked.
cmu-paramarines-greeting = You are a paratrooper of the Third World Empire's IASF Parachute Regiment. Your detachment has been dropped into this theatre to further imperial interests. Follow your team leader and complete the mission. For Empress and country.
